---
/**
 * The heading a content page opens with.
 *
 * `<h2>` in the Rails views, not `<h1>` -- the layout carries no page-level
 * h1, so these pages have had an h2 as their first heading throughout. Kept
 * rather than corrected: changing every marketing page's heading level in the
 * same change that moves them is two changes wearing one commit, and the one
 * that alters what a screen reader announces deserves its own.
 */
---
<header>
  <h2 class="mt-8 mb-6 text-h2"><slot /></h2>
</header>
